<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>박하은</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #fafafa;
            color: #222;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .box {
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        }
        p {
            color: #666;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
        }
        a {
            color: #222;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin: 0 4px;
            background-color: #fff;
        }
        a:hover {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="box">
        <h1>박하은</h1>
        <p>안녕하세요, 고등학생 박하은입니다.</p>
        <div>
            <a href="#">Blog</a>
            <a href="#">Guestbook</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
